# Generator callback user throw

```scalascript
val values = generator[Int] { () => suspend(8) }
val message = try {
  values.foreach(_ => throw new RuntimeException("generator-user-boom"))
  "unexpected"
} catch {
  case error: RuntimeException => error.getMessage
}
println(message)
```
